      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why should it be the guest tests compilation image version?\nSpecifically the docker side matters less for ***image building***, so it made sense to use the same version(docker) for building as the version(vm) being built.\nWith that in mind, the 26.04 image maker script (in our maman 12 commit https://review.gerrithub.io/c/davidsaOpenu/simulator/+/1238231 ) requires libguestfs commands and comand options that are newer than ubuntu 14.04 and requires the 26.04 container.",
